{
  "title": "Luscious Dutch Beef Klapstuk",
  "description": "A weeknight Dutch dish featuring tender beef in a rich, spicy sauce, served with boiled potatoes. This recipe is vegan-friendly by using a shio-cure substitute.",
  "cuisine": "Dutch",
  "diet": [
    "beef",
